#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{} v{}\n"
"Open-source IPTV player for Enigma2. Supports Xtream Codes accounts and Live TV from standard local, mounted-network or HTTP(S) M3U playlists. Plain M3U sources provide Live TV only.\n"
"\n"
"DEVELOPER\n"
"{}\n"
"\n"
"LEGAL NOTICE\n"
"This plugin does not provide channels, streams, accounts or playlists. The user is responsible for using only content for which they have access and usage rights.\n"
"\n"
"PRIVACY\n"
"When Open-Meteo is enabled, the selected city and location are sent to Open-Meteo for the weather forecast. When TMDb is enabled, the movie/series title and the TMDb key or token entered by the user are sent to TMDb. The IPTV username and password are not sent to these services."
msgstr ""
"{} v{}\n"
"Odprtokodni predvajalnik IPTV za Enigma2. Podpira račune Xtream Codes ter televizijo v živo s standardnih lokalnih, omrežno priklopljenih ali spletnih seznamov predvajanja M3U prek HTTP(S). Navadni viri M3U ponujajo samo televizijo v živo.\n"
"\n"
"RAZVIJALEC\n"
"{}\n"
"\n"
"PRAVNO OBVESTILO\n"
"Ta vtičnik ne ponuja kanalov, pretokov, računov ali seznamov predvajanja. Uporabnik je odgovoren za uporabo izključno tistih vsebin, do katerih ima dostop in pravico do uporabe.\n"
"\n"
"ZASEBNOST\n"
"Ko je storitev Open-Meteo omogočena, se izbrano mesto in lokacija pošljeta storitvi Open-Meteo za pripravo vremenske napovedi. Ko je storitev TMDb omogočena, se naslov filma ali serije ter ključ ali žeton TMDb, ki ga vnese uporabnik, pošljejo storitvi TMDb. Uporabniško ime in geslo IPTV se tema storitvama ne pošiljata."

